### Get all pets
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets

### Get all pets - filter by species (Dog)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?species=Dog

### Get all pets - filter by species (Cat)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?species=Cat

### Get all pets - sort by name (ascending)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?sortBy=name&order=asc

### Get all pets - sort by name (descending)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?sortBy=name&order=desc

### Get all pets - sort by hunger level
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?sortBy=hungerLevel&order=asc

### Get all pets - sort by happiness level
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?sortBy=happinessLevel&order=desc

### Get all pets - pagination (offset=2, limit=3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?offset=2&limit=3

### Get all pets - combined (Cats, sorted by name, with pagination)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?species=Cat&sortBy=name&order=asc&offset=0&limit=2

### Get pet by ID (Rex)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1

### Get pet by ID (Garfield)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets/2

### Get pet by ID - non-existent (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets/999999

### Create new pet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bella",
  "species": "Dog"
}

### Create new pet - with explicit hunger/happiness
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Max",
  "species": "Cat",
  "hungerLevel": 7,
  "happinessLevel": 8
}

### Create new pet - invalid (name too long, should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "This name is way too long for validation",
  "species": "Dog"
}

### Create new pet - invalid (blank name, should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "species": "Dog"
}

### Create new pet - invalid (hunger level out of range, should return 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "species": "Dog",
  "hungerLevel": 15
}

### Feed Rex (id = 1)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1/feed

### Feed Quack (id = 4) - has hunger = 1, feed once to make it 0
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/4/feed

### Feed Quack again (should return 400 - pet is full)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/4/feed

### Play with Garfield (id = 2) - has happiness = 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/2/play

### Play with Rex (id = 1) - has happiness = 10, should return 400
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/1/play

### Feed non-existent pet (should return 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/999/feed

### Play with non-existent pet (should return 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/pets/999/play

### Delete pet (id = 6, Spot)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/pets/6

### Delete non-existent pet (should return 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/pets/999

### Verify Spot is deleted (should return 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets/6
